     a as (select $proc${"hosts": [{"host": "pvc.elumenapp.com", "access": "open", "platform": "elumen", "note": "Palo Verde's eLumen catalog (2025-2026). The menu's publish call links seven award hubs (programs, adt, associate-of-arts-degrees, associate-of-science-degrees, certificate-of-achievements, certificate-of-career-preparations, non-credit-certificates), not programs or departments; each hub's content call links its programs at 2025-2026/program/<slug>, and each program's content call carries its requirements. The reader makes the menu call once, one call a hub and one a program: el_hub_slugs() (S384, #2085)."}], "steps": [{"run": "38461110935", "date": "2026-10-13", "plan": "program-requirements-college.yml, capture only (S384, #2085)", "found": "84 program pages through the seven hubs; 54 of 69 programs found a page, 32 at full coverage."}, {"run": "38477849603", "date": "2026-10-13", "plan": "program-requirements-college.yml, read with extraction (Sam, Sheet 77 card 5: both)", "found": "54 of 68 programs with a course list found a page and were extracted; 29 pass the machine checks; $4.40 in model calls."}, {"run": "38482990981", "date": "2026-10-13", "plan": "program-requirements-college.yml, load", "found": "52 records inserted unchecked (receipt kb/receipts/program_requirement_records_college_palo_verde_38482990981.json); 22479 Business Management and 32252 Business Administration place none of their listed courses and stay out."}, {"run": "38486049156", "date": "2026-10-13", "plan": "program-requirements-college.yml, display", "found": "Display build 2d812b8ce768 applied to all 3,077 rows, Palo Verde's 52 among them; the applied record beside the receipt is the rollback."}, {"run": "38491285062", "date": "2026-10-14", "plan": "kb/college_reads/pvc_noncredit_programs.json (S386)", "found": "The noncredit hub lists three programs (English As a Second Language Certificate of Completion, High School Equivalency, NON-CREDIT English as a Second Language II). High School Equivalency's page prints NBE031-NBE034, 144 hours each, total 576; the state's Program Course File lists GED031-GED034 for 43203, the same numbers and titles. Developing Capable Youth's page (a 2021-22 version) is a credit Certificate of Career Preparation with CHD120 (2 units) and CHD227 (1 unit); the state file lists the noncredit NBE 120 and NBE 227 for 45472. Three page loads."}], "open": [{"question": "25 of 54 records fail the arithmetic check: 21 name no program total and 4 sum to a figure other than the printed one (three Fire Science certificates, 41208, 41227 and 41260, and Child Development-Teacher 22484).", "next": "Read two of the 21 pages (Automotive Technology A.S. 04442, Psychology AA-T 30594) to see whether the page prints a total the record left out."}, {"question": "Four noncredit programs have no record. High School Equivalency 43203 and Developing Capable Youth 45472 print their courses under other codes than the state file lists (run 38491285062), so no page carries a listed code. Child Care 45471 and Arts - Early Childhood Education 45473 have no page in the 2025-2026 catalog.", "next": "These are the college's to correct in its catalog or in COCI. Whether the harvest counts a course printed under another subject, with the same number and title, as the listed one is not decided; S386 measured 32 such pairs of 257 same-number pairs on loaded records at four colleges."}, {"question": "Five more programs found no page: 09816 Vocational Nursing, 45359 Cal-GETC, 45959 Umoja Scholars, 46108 Microsoft Word Specialist, 46556 Cross-Cultural Awareness.", "next": "Look for each under another title in the hubs before a re-read."}, {"question": "Five programs lost their only page to a program it names more fully: 43010 Communication Studies 2.0, 45376 Alcohol and Drug Studies, 46554 and 46555 Anthropology, 46557 Emphasis on Studies of the Americas.", "next": "Find each program's own page."}], "nuances": ["The 2025-2026 catalog keeps older program versions at addresses naming their year (high-school-equivalency-program-2022-23-spring-2023sp, ...-2021-22-summer-2022su); read the hubs, never a stored address.", "A noncredit page prints hours under its Units heading: High School Equivalency's header reads 288.0 Units and its course list totals 576 hours."], "answers": [{"question": "How the catalog lists its programs", "status": "answered", "answer": "Through seven award hubs the menu links; each hub's page links its programs (S382 menu reads, S384 #2085)."}], "reader_add": "; program reads by kb/_program_requirements_college.py (el_pages_fast with el_hub_slugs(): the menu's publish call once, one content call a hub and one a program)"}$proc$::jsonb a)
